      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "AI drafts to approve; today's leads; a Connection's Ask matching what the Company sells; a Hot Company not yet contacted; connection requests; profile gaps; freshness nudge after 14 days unchanged; You're all caught up. Each carries a 'Shown because...' sentence."
    },
